{"id":"35827b4b6670766d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-communication-protocol.md","title":"Two-Party Communication Protocol","display":"df-communication-protocol — Two-Party Communication Protocol","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-communication-protocol","aliases":["28-df-communication-protocol","Two-Party Communication Protocol"],"display":"df-communication-protocol — Two-Party Communication Protocol","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 13.1; protocol-tree formalization","source_printed_pages":"271–274","source_pdf_pages":"297–300","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-communication-protocol"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-communication-protocol</span><span>Two-Party Communication Protocol</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-communication-protocol — Two-Party Communication Protocol"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 13.1; protocol-tree formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"271–274"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"297–300"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为有限非空输入集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\preceq s\">\\(h\\preceq s\\)</span> 表示前缀。</li>\n<li>候选协议 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,(A_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)},(B_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)})\">\\(\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,(A_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)},(B_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，发送方标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf A,\\mathsf B\">\\(\\mathsf A,\\mathsf B\\)</span> 互异。</li>\n<li>后续路径、成本与输出只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)\">\\(\\Pi\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\">\\((x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\)</span> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\">\\(h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 递归，字串坐标从 1 起。</li>\n<li>最后发送的输出比特也计入通信；停止与下一发送方由公开历史决定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{Int}(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus\\operatorname{Leaf}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{Int}(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus\\operatorname{Leaf}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,(A_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)},(B_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)}):\\;&amp;T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |T|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\epsilon\\notin\\operatorname{Leaf}(T),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\quad\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\\\\n&amp;\\lambda:\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\to\\{\\mathsf A,\\mathsf B\\},\\quad\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\ [A_h:X\\to\\Sigma\\land B_h:Y\\to\\Sigma]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,(A_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)},(B_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)}):\\;&amp;T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |T|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\epsilon\\notin\\operatorname{Leaf}(T),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\quad\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\\\\n&amp;\\lambda:\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\to\\{\\mathsf A,\\mathsf B\\},\\quad\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\ [A_h:X\\to\\Sigma\\land B_h:Y\\to\\Sigma]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h_0^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{j+1}^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)&amp;h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T),\\\\\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)A_{h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)}(x)&amp;h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T),\\ \\lambda(h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y))=\\mathsf A,\\\\\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)B_{h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)}(y)&amp;h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T),\\ \\lambda(h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y))=\\mathsf B.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h_0^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{j+1}^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)&amp;h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T),\\\\\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)A_{h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)}(x)&amp;h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T),\\ \\lambda(h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y))=\\mathsf A,\\\\\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)B_{h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)}(y)&amp;h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T),\\ \\lambda(h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y))=\\mathsf B.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\},\\quad \\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq t_\\Pi(x,y),\\quad \\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq \\bigl(h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\bigr)_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\},\\quad \\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq t_\\Pi(x,y),\\quad \\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq \\bigl(h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\bigr)_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\langle h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi}(x,y),\\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\langle h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi}(x,y),\\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有限树保证停机，且没有通过空消息或未知消息边界免费传递信息。有限树的最后一位是公开输出，因此输出通信也计费。连续同一发送方的位可合成书中的一个消息；本地计算不计费。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 13.1; protocol-tree formalization，印刷页 271–274；PDF 页 297–300。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"h\\preceq s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,(A_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)},(B_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)})","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf A,\\mathsf B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"(x,y)\\in X\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in T:h0\\notin T\\land h1\\notin T\\},\\qquad \\operatorname{Int}(T)\\coloneqq T\\setminus\\operatorname{Leaf}(T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\lambda,(A_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)},(B_h)_{h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)}):\\;&T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{<\\omega},\\ |T|<\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\epsilon\\notin\\operatorname{Leaf}(T),\\\\\n&\\forall s\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq s\\ h\\in T,\\quad\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\ \\{h0,h1\\}\\subseteq T,\\\\\n&\\lambda:\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\to\\{\\mathsf A,\\mathsf B\\},\\quad\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T)\\ [A_h:X\\to\\Sigma\\land B_h:Y\\to\\Sigma]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"h_0^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad h_{j+1}^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)&h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T),\\\\\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)A_{h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)}(x)&h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T),\\ \\lambda(h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y))=\\mathsf A,\\\\\nh_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)B_{h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)}(y)&h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Int}(T),\\ \\lambda(h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y))=\\mathsf B.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"t_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:h_j^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{Leaf}(T)\\},\\quad \\operatorname{cost}_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq t_\\Pi(x,y),\\quad \\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq \\bigl(h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi}(x,y)\\bigr)_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi(x,y)\\coloneqq\\langle h_{t_\\Pi(x,y)}^{\\Pi}(x,y),\\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":3047,"backlinks":[{"id":"fec568b8ee2173ba","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X,Y$ 为有限非空输入集，$f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}$ 见 [[28-df-communication-protocol]]。"},{"id":"b1e5640471f82a1d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comm},\\operatorname{out},\\operatorname{cost}$ 见 [[28-df-communication-protocol]]；公开随机协议是有限均匀随机串选择的确定型协议族 $(\\Pi_r)_{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{\\ell}}$。"},{"id":"58c74e9d605c12da","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X,Y$ 有限非空，$f:X\\times Y\\to\\{0,1\\}$；$\\Pi=(T,\\lambda,(A_h),(B_h))\\in\\operatorname{Comm}(X,Y)$ 见 [[28-df-communication-protocol]]，且 $\\forall(x,y)\\in X\\times Y\\;\\operatorname{out}_\\Pi(x,y)=f(x,y)$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"通信模型：[[28-df-communication-protocol]]、[[28-df-deterministic-communication-complexity]]、[[28-df-randomized-communication-complexity]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}